      "lines": [
        "в) 没有一个元素是自反的。",
        "2) 在给定关系中什么关系是对称的？什么关系不是对称",
        "的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "332",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "332. 证明：对于变量 $c$ 的所有值，下列不等式成立：",
        "а) $\\frac{c^2+1}{2}\\geqslant c$；　б) $\\frac{c}{c^2+1}\\leqslant\\frac{1}{2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "333",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "333. 证明：对于所指出的变量值，下列不等式成立：",
        "а) $9a+\\frac{1}{a}\\geqslant 6$，当 $a>0$ 时；",
        "б) $\\frac{x}{5}+\\frac{5}{x}\\leqslant-2$，当 $x<0$ 时。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "334",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "334. 化简：$\\left(a-\\frac{a^2+b^2}{a+b}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{2}{a-b}\\right)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "335",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "335. 化简：",
        "а) $\\left(\\frac{25x^{-2}}{y^{-4}}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{y^{-5}}{125x^{-3}}\\right)^2$；",
        "б) $\\left(\\frac{0.3p^3}{4q^{-5}}\\right)^{-2}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{2q^{-4}}{1.5p^2}\\right)^{-3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "16. “小于”和“大于”关系的性质（续）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们再来研究“小于”和“大于”关系的另外几个性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理 1　如果 $a<b$，$c$ 是任意数，那么 $a+c<b+c$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用数轴很容易表明，这个论断对于正数 $c$（图 10）和负",
        "数 $c$（图 11）都是正确的。对于 $c=0$ 显然是正确的。"
      ]
    },
